TI  - Diagnostic accuracy of ultrasound-guided core needle biopsy versus incisional biopsy in soft tissue sarcoma: an institutional experience
AU  - Cernakova M
AU  - Hobusch GM
AU  - Amann G
AU  - Funovics PT
